{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["And I — in that land I have given you one portion more than your brothers, for Menashe and Efrayim, like Reuven and Shimon, are mine, so that you take two portions in the land that I and my sons are destined to take." "From the hand of the Amorite with my sword and with my bow — in the war of Yehoshua. And even though it is written in Yehoshua ״לא בחרבך ולא בקשתך״, that verse speaks of the two kings of the Amorite, and as the Sages said: the hornet did not cross the Jordan. And it is written in Yehoshua: ״ואשלח לפניכם את הצרעה״, and ״ותגרש אותם מפניכם שני מלכי האמורי״, ״אשר בעבר הירדן לא בחרבך ולא בקשתך״ — the merit of Yaakov availed them."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 48, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:47:37.413853760Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}